    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115629" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψήν</span></b> , ὁ, gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψηνός,</span>
